==Strategy==
This level's gimmick is to face waves of enemies controlled by enemy limit and manage your cash. You will first see a Face being supported by some Zrocos. [[Cameraman Cat]] is recommended for this job. Save money as much as possible, as the first wave of Li'l Bun Buns will come after they are killed twice (once if you bring a Zombie Killer). Use your anti-floating units to deal with them (Cameraman and Sanzo are recommended). Once all Li'l Bun Buns are killed, some Zackie Pengs will come (they aren't a threat at all), and you must use them to prepare for the 2nd wave. You will get much more cash so you won't have to worry if you spam a heavy hitter. After that, The Face is very easy to deal with, just beware of the ocassional Li'l Bun Buns that are slowly spawned.

